{room, key=portal_01, name=Portal 1
    {attrib, output=false, tags=tested }
    {attrib, output=false, tags=entered }
    {attrib, tags=navigation
        output={@
f - forward
b - backward
j - jump
c - crouch
        }
    }

    {enter_message
        output={@
You find yourself in a narrow world. It is impossible to move to either side.
It is a bright place. Blue sky unfolds above you and there are small fluffy
clouds dotting it. Everything looks very pixelated.

You seem to be in an 8bit side scroller!


<?[room]((entered)) = 'false'?>
A blocky wizard approaches you.
"Hello traveler!
In this world, you can go forward (f), backward (b), jump (j), crouch (c).
Good luck!"
Then the wizard goes up in a poof of pixelated smoke.
</?>

Ahead of you is a brick wall with a ladder ascending upward.

        }
        
        {logic, name=Multiplexer portal 01 tested, tags=!_test
            logic={@
                ?[self]((tested)) = 'true'
            }
        }
    }

    {look
        {message
            output={@
You are in a narrow world. It is impossible to move to either side.

Ahead of you is a brick wall with a ladder ascending upward.

            }
        }
    }


    {inject, logic=/nav.inj }
    {inject, logic=/look.inj }



    {input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((go_forward))
        {move, logic=pt01_001002, tags=[player]
            output={@

You step forward and climb up the ladder.
            }
        }
    }
}
